-- Region ids become the wilayah.id codes without dots, stored as TEXT:
-- province "31", city "3171", district "317107", sub-district "3171071001".
-- A 10 digit code does not fit a 32 bit integer (3171071001 > 2147483647).
--
-- Step 1 (generated by Prisma): change the region ids and every column that points at them to TEXT.

